meta {
  name: Get store content for a slug, release date and description
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

get {
  url: https://store-content.ak.epicgames.com/api/en-GB/content/products/{{epic_store_slug}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

vars:pre-request {
  epic_store_slug: manifold-garden
}

docs {
  Unauthenticated. Verified live 2026-08-30 as the best source for releaseDate,
  publisher and a real description — the catalog item has none of these.

  pages[type=productHome].data.meta.releaseDate, developer[], publisher[] and
  data.about.shortDescription. Get the slug first from "Get store slug for a
  namespace".
}
